# Data and checkpoints are large and regenerable. Benchmark outputs in
# results/ are deliberately NOT ignored: they are the evidence for the README.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `data/` also matches
# src/nanoscope/data/, the pipeline's source package, and would silently drop
# it from version control.
/data/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.bin

